}</p>
<p>@keyframes productReveal {
0% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.85) translateY(8%); }
100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
}</p>
<p>/* Fabric texture on product */
#s6 .product-sim::before {
content: &#39;&#39;;
position: absolute;
inset: 0;
background:
repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 6px);
}</p>
<p>/* CCC emblem on product */
#s6 .product-emblem {
